    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "it to Black Fox, and he"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 296,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "will help you achieve"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "your goal of becoming"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "a Gunslinger."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Ah, you've returned"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "with everything I need."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Please give me some time"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "to make the voucher. If you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "come back in a little while,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "I should be finished with it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Oh, you've arrived just"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "in time. It's been a while"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "since I've made one of these vouchers, so I might be a little"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "rusty. Still, this really takes me back to the days of my youth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "I've been serving in this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "position of choosing worthy"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "recipients of Gunslinger"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "vouchers for a few decades"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "now. But before that, I was a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "young adventurer just like you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "It feels like it was only"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "yesterday when I held my own"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "little voucher as a Gunslinger,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 337,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "a warrior of the earth. That's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "when I met Selena's father..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "How can time pass so quickly?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Ah... I really appreciate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Selena and Black Fox for all"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "of their help in recruiting"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "young Gunslingers. I'm very"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 346,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "old now, and can't do everything by myself. *Sigh...* Such is life."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Before you leave, may"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "I ask you for a small favor?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "I'm thirsty, and would like"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "a cold glass of Milk. Would"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "you please bring me some?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "I'm an old man that will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "soon be reunited with mother"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "earth. Would you do this old"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Gunslinger a favor a bring me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "a cold glass of Milk, please?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 372,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Oh, thank you for your!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 373,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "generosity--I see that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 374,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "you've brought me some"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Milk. Ahhhh, delicious~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 377,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "I admire the patience,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "gentleness, and kindness"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 380,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "that you've proven by bringing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "this to me. Yes, those are traits we all want Gunslingers to have."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 383,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "[Wise Bull Horn]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 384,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "Now, please take this voucher"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "to Miller, the Black Fox, with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 386,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "my wholehearted approval."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "I hope that you will use your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "gun to uphold justice as a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Wise Bull Horn",
      "text" : "noble warrior of the earth."
